<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-049" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family" source-id="s-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family-ws2261984">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>聞兵入，還內禮佛，未及起，軍人遂斬之。年五十九。執<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p001:m0026" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAC">彪</persName>及弟<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p001:m0029" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAD">爽</persName>、<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p001:m0031" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAE">弼</persName>、<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p001:m0033" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">殷叡</persName>，皆伏誅。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p002:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>長子太子中庶子<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p002:m0008" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAB">融</persName>，<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p002:m0010" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAB">融</persName>弟司徒從事中郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p002:m0018" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAA">琛</persName>，於都棄市。餘孫皆原宥。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p003:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p003:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AC"></persName><persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p003:m0003" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ACA">女</persName>爲長沙王<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p003:m0008" ref="so0_qrg_ltt">晃</persName>妃，世祖詔曰：「<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p003:m0017" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>自陷逆節，長沙王妃男女竝長，且<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p003:m0033" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AA">奐</persName>又出繼，前代或當有准，可特不離絕。」</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">第三息<persName id="c-nanqishu-049-wanghuan-final-family:p004:m0003" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAC">彪</persName>矯弄威權，父子均勢。</p>
</text>
